<title>USA: Apple and Quintal settle patent dispute.</title>
<headline>Apple and Quintal settle patent dispute.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc and Quintal Research Group Inc on Friday said they have settled a two-year patent dispute over a patent owned by Quintal.</p>
<p>The patent, which was licensed by Apple, relates to an iconic data management system. Quintal said the patent is available for licensing by others.</p>
</text>
